INITIALIZATION.

*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& START-OF-SELECTION
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
START-OF-SELECTION.

  DATA: lv_reqtype TYPE ztb_a2r_reqtype-z_reqtype.

  " Get selected request type
  PERFORM get_request_type CHANGING lv_reqtype.

  " Store request type in memory for next program
  EXPORT lv_reqtype FROM lv_reqtype TO MEMORY ID 'ZCJ00_REQTYPE'.

  " Route to appropriate program/screen
  CASE lv_reqtype.
    WHEN 'A1'.  " Create New Project
      SUBMIT ztr_a2r_wbscj01 VIA SELECTION-SCREEN AND RETURN.
      CALL TRANSACTION 'ZA2R_ZCJ01' AND SKIP FIRST SCREEN.

    WHEN 'B1'.  " Add CAR
      MESSAGE i001 WITH 'Request Type B1 not yet implemented'(m05).

    WHEN 'B2'.  " Non-critical change
      MESSAGE i001 WITH 'Request Type B2 not yet implemented'(m06).

    WHEN 'B3'.  " Critical change
      MESSAGE i001 WITH 'Request Type B3 not yet implemented'(m07).

    WHEN 'C1'.  " Partial Capitalization
      MESSAGE i001 WITH 'Request Type C1 not yet implemented'(m01).

    WHEN 'D1'.  " Close WBS
      MESSAGE i001 WITH 'Request Type D1 not yet implemented'(m02).

    WHEN 'E1'.  " Unclose WBS
      MESSAGE i001 WITH 'Request Type E1 not yet implemented'(m03).

    WHEN 'F1'.  " Edit Request
      CALL TRANSACTION 'ZA2R_EDITSAVED' AND SKIP FIRST SCREEN.

    WHEN 'G1'.  " WBS Request Reporting
      SUBMIT zre_a2r_wbscj01 VIA SELECTION-SCREEN AND RETURN.
      CALL TRANSACTION 'ZA2R_ZCJ00REPORT' AND SKIP FIRST SCREEN.

    WHEN OTHERS.
      MESSAGE e001 WITH lv_reqtype.
  ENDCASE.

